{"games":[{"id":1486528523,"name":"[UPDATE] RCPD:FR","desc":"💰 Plan the perfect heist with your friends & escape the police.\n🚗 Drive cool cars through the city streets.\n🚓 Patrol as the police and track down criminals.\n🚑 Respond to emergencies & save lives.\n\n| Leave a like & join our group to show your support!\n| Check out our social links for Development Updates & Sneakpeaks, additionally we have Ticket System there for Alt Detection Issues and Player Reports!\n| This is a roleplay enforced game, please read & follow our rules in-game.","path":"/game/1486528523-rcpd-fr","slug":"1486528523-rcpd-fr","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/95f826476be48ae3331868c1530680fc63141bf42507c1ac689904f4d7dd982b.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-56e8373e5f778cbdf407e3641ec441ad/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":25,"visitor":7311314,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-21T05:11:30.293Z","creator":{"name":"First Response Studios.","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":14034093693,"name":"[❄️] School FR RP 🇫🇷","desc":"🏫 Become the most popular student in school! \n👔 Create your own courses as a teacher! \n🍳 Prepare dishes as a cook! \n🅿 Become a supervisor to enforce the rules! \n💼 Manage the time schedules and the building as a provisor! \n🎒 Earn money for exclusive items! \n📏 Will you be a hard-working student or a rebellious one? \n❔ Discover the mysteries of the establishment ! \n🔥 And much more! \n\nWelcome to the French School RP of Roblox!\n\nThis School RP experience is a school with a unique middle school/high school experience. You can play in a school as a teacher, student, cook... A typical game with voice chat!\n\nModerators are present to ensure that you have high-quality role-play in this game, and we do our best to ensure that this school role-play meets your expectations! (Codes / Events / RP Servers)\n\nWill you become the most diligent or most rebellious student of this School R